WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.660
Hey guys,&nbsp;

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:03.360
Nikita and I were just at a&nbsp;
fuel station, filled up the car.&nbsp;

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:08.520
And there was someone there and we&nbsp;
started the conversation with him.&nbsp;

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:14.280
And I asked him, do you love Jesus Christ?
And he shared with us something terrible&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:18.780
that just happened to him and that he's struggling&nbsp;
with something and that his two kids - the one is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:25.620
in the hospital the other one was just attacked&nbsp;
- hand cut off - and the tears started to flow.&nbsp;

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:32.880
And we talked to him a little bit and I felt that&nbsp;
the Holy Spirit led us to be there at this time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:37.620
for this person who is also called Daniel.
So I want to remind you to not just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:44.100
be so self-absorbing in your own bubble.
There are people out there that need your light.&nbsp;

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:47.340
You need to share the Gospel.
Be the light.&nbsp;

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:54.120
And listen to the Holy Spirit so that when&nbsp;
people need you - need God - but God working&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:59.460
through you - then you are there for them.
Love other people as you love yourself.

